{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_45_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_45","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_45_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_45","textTraditional":"十有六年春王正月。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_45_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_45","textTraditional":"夏，宋人、齊人、衛人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_45_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_45","textTraditional":"秋，荊伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_45_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_45","textTraditional":"冬十有二月，會齊侯、宋公、陳侯、衛侯、鄭伯、許男、滑伯、滕子同盟于幽。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_45_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_45","textTraditional":"邾子克卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_45_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_45","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_45_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_45","textTraditional":"十六年夏，諸侯伐鄭，宋故也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_45_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_45","textTraditional":"鄭伯自櫟入，緩告于楚。秋，楚伐鄭，及櫟，為不禮故也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_45_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_45","textTraditional":"鄭伯治與於雍糾之亂者，九月，殺公子閼，刖強鉏。公父定叔出奔衛。三年而復之，曰：「不可使共叔無後於鄭。」使以十月入，曰：「良月也，就盈數焉。」君子謂：「強鉏不能衛其足。」","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_45_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_45","textTraditional":"冬，同盟于幽，鄭成也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_45_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_45","textTraditional":"王使虢公命曲沃伯以一軍為晉侯。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_45_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_45","textTraditional":"初，晉武公伐夷，執夷詭諸。蒍國請而免之。既而弗報。故子國作亂，謂晉人曰：「與我伐夷而取其地。」遂以晉師伐夷，殺夷詭諸。周公忌父出奔虢。惠王立而復之。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}